276
00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:42.310
Sa ütlesid,
et süüdistatav on alati kostja.

277
00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:43.730
Seda küll.

278
00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:47.580
Kui see, kes hagi kaasa toob,
no see, kes on hagiga pundis

279
00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.930
