303
00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.910
Musta mere ääres

304
00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:58.480
Jaltas alguses on palju toota.
Miks sa olid Jaltas musta mere

305
00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:01.130
