318
00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:52.200
Aga mis just Kalju või?

319
00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:52.920
Mina ei tea, läks.

320
00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:56.100
Nii kes see teab,
kust kõik see algab, peiu vaikib,

321
00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.810
